{*
 * CubeCart v6 — Atrium skin
 * License:  GPL-3.0 https://www.gnu.org/licenses/quick-guide-gplv3.html
 *
 * $SOCIAL_LINKS from GUI::_displaySocial() is {url, name, icon}. `icon` is a
 * bare Font-Awesome-era name ('facebook-square', 'bsky', ...) — NOT a file
 * path — so it is matched here and rendered as inline SVG.
 *
 * WHY INLINE AND NOT <img>
 * fill="currentColor" lets each mark inherit the surrounding text colour. The
 * footer band is dark with white text (--color-chrome-fg), so a flat-coloured
 * image file would have to be re-exported per theme; this just works.
 *
 * ICON SOURCES — both redistributable under GPL-3.0:
 *   simple-icons (CC0-1.0, public domain) for all but LinkedIn.
 *   LinkedIn comes from bootstrap-icons (MIT) because simple-icons DELISTED it
 *   at LinkedIn's request — /icons/linkedin.svg is a 404 there. That is also
 *   why its viewBox is 0 0 16 16 while the rest are 0 0 24 24; do not
 *   "normalise" them, the paths are drawn to different grids.
 *
 * Brand marks remain the trademarks of their owners. They are used here only
 * to link a merchant to their own profile.
 *
 * TWITTER USES THE X MARK deliberately: core still labels it 'Twitter' with
 * icon 'twitter-square', but sends visitors to x.com, so the X logo is what
 * they actually land on.
 *
 * The final {else} keeps the old text pill, so a network added to core that
 * has no icon here still renders a working, labelled link.
 *}
{if $SOCIAL_LINKS}
<div class="element-social">
   <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-900">{$LANG.common.follow_us}</h3>
   <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3 md:justify-end">
      {foreach from=$SOCIAL_LINKS item=link}
      <li>
         <a href="{$link.url}" title="{$link.name}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="cc-social-link">
            <span class="cc-sr-only">{$link.name}</span>
      {if $link.icon == 'facebook-square'}{* facebook *}
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.101 23.691v-7.98H6.627v-3.667h2.474v-1.58c0-4.085 1.848-5.978 5.858-5.978.401 0 .955.042 1.468.103a8.68 8.68 0 0 1 1.141.195v3.325a8.623 8.623 0 0 0-.653-.036 26.805 26.805 0 0 0-.733-.009c-.707 0-1.259.096-1.675.309a1.686 1.686 0 0 0-.679.622c-.258.42-.374.995-.374 1.752v1.297h3.919l-.386 2.103-.287 1.564h-3.246v8.245C19.396 23.238 24 18.179 24 12.044c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.628 3.874 10.35 9.101 11.647Z"/></svg>
